Description: load the music as FLAC with libsndfile
 The non-compo build loads the precalculated music with SDL_LoadWAV, which
 only reads WAV. The 37 MB float WAV is shipped as FLAC to keep the data
 package small, and was converted back to WAV by the maintainer scripts.
 Read the FLAC file directly with libsndfile instead (sf_readf_float gives
 the float samples the intro expects), so no conversion is needed at
 installation time. libsndfile was already referenced by the build system
 for the record mode, but never searched for: find it with pkg-config.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
